<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-CMS Energy price target up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CMS Energy price target up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said Friday it raised its 12-month price target on CMS Energy Corp to $39 from $34.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The price improvements in CMS stock have been steady for several years as earnings and dividends have moved up regularly,&quot; Gruntal pointed out in a report.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 33-1/4.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
